WEBVTT

00:04:29.312 --> 00:04:32.428
As a proud night owl, I free up
my afternoons and evenings

00:04:32.452 --> 00:04:33.622
for creative work.

00:04:33.646 --> 00:04:35.487
And I know I'll get more writing done

00:04:35.511 --> 00:04:38.118
in the cozy winter months
than during the summer.

00:04:38.142 --> 00:04:39.428
And that's the secret.

00:04:39.452 --> 00:04:42.388
Dismantling myths,
challenging your old views,

00:04:42.412 --> 00:04:43.846
identifying your narratives --

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:46.738
this is the real work
that we need to be doing.

00:04:46.762 --> 00:04:48.200
We aren't machines,

00:04:48.224 --> 00:04:50.922
and I think it's time
that we stopped working like one.